checkpoint_2026_08_28_companion_source_operation_contract:
  status: remote_exact_green_checkpoint
  source_control: Implementation commit 5a9c097e66a83ceb6ee71ebe36462981e311baf6, tree e3ebbec3c910b60e54280eff4d4643196b28b87f, is pushed and fresh-fetch exact across local HEAD, tracking, FETCH_HEAD, and the direct remote branch ref.
  implementation_memory: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-companion-source-operation-contract-memory-2026-08-28.md,14694,4867d2270defe57e8bd495ab59e25a20b56897518f26ee0be51b4804a6a9126c
  intake_authority: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-enterprise-intake-and-production-runtime-clean-cut-memory-2026-08-28.md,20316,6e5a5b7cf7f3ad45008b14597a3616ee603da76cc500b69770de7280711785e4
  result: The sole current Companion wire is loopback-capability/4 plus acquire.v2, operation.v3, and operation-projection.v2. It requires one explicit attempt, the exact pinned Qwen3 source and corrected composition profile /4, source-only route, private create-only execution/source evidence whose intent and receipt bind one canonical nine-file payload inventory, independent browser and managed enforcement of the same source constants, pairwise nonoverlapping custody roots, authoritative create-only history with current-cache lag bounded to one record and repaired under both locks before another append, reclaimed exact-key mutation gates, a bounded five-second cancellation mutation wait, monotonic terminal state, and exact six-member fixed-chunk transfer. Superseded request/operation/projection readers, arbitrary inventory digests, and fake peer states are absent from the current executable path.
  verification: Managed Release solution 252/252 with Companion 125, Core 86, and package boundary 41; warnings as errors and format gate pass; focused browser/vector 19/19; standard Node partition 1702 pass, zero fail, three declared skips, 1705 total; diff hygiene passes.
  release_truth: The listener still returns typed operation-not-available, no production operation executor or source-network owner exists, the browser client is not loaded by the product UI, and no real source, conversion, model, browser chat, P2P, deployment, publication, or live MemoryEndpoints evidence exists.
  next_gate: Implement the preregistered exclusive restart-safe source operation owner, bounded pinned-source streaming, contained converter launch, and terminal six-member inspection before wiring listener routes or deleting the superseded UI bridge in one later green clean cut.
  memory_policy: MemoryEndpoints is authorized and strongly recommended for portable continuity; configured or reachable state is not authenticated live lifecycle evidence.
  campaign_truth: 0/20 qualified; 0/50 browser; 0/25 live memory; 0/40 outside lanes; 0/20 catalog.

checkpoint_2026_08_28_companion_operation_and_artifact_boundary:
  source: artifact_transfer_commit=75caaa0b9d08972c510cd048f853cbba8bee375c; operation_service_commit=0eb97b69508e490111eb9c77b4b0888bbdd5513d; latest_tree=ef45e775ab535447f074b4a337af26b4d2411c95
  remote_equality: The latest local commit and tree equal a freshly fetched origin branch commit and tree; both coherent changes were pushed before this memory update.
  verification: Managed Release solution=235 pass/0 fail/0 skip: Companion 108, Core 86, package boundary 41. Formatting and diff hygiene pass with zero warnings.
  result: Companion now owns canonical operation projection, create-only same-ID cancellation intent, terminal-race-safe cancellation service semantics, cross-root-isolated journal locks, and bounded source-composition artifact transfer. Transfer independently re-inspects exact terminal evidence, closes six-member path and identity authority, uses fixed 4194304-byte chunks, verifies before serving, rehashes after the final chunk, and never exposes a private path.
  release_truth: These are private source-controlled service components, not an active product route. The production host still returns proven operation-not-available because no real P2P-or-pinned-source acquisition executor exists; the browser client remains unloaded and CompanionBridge plus one-file acquisition/sharing semantics remain active release blockers. Do not wire a queued fiction or a fixture executor.
  next_gate: Implement one real restart-safe acquisition executor and source/P2P custody, then connect operation service and artifact metadata to the strict server, activate the sole browser client, and delete CompanionBridge plus every one-file acquisition/sharing path in the same green clean cut.
  deep_link: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-enterprise-intake-and-production-runtime-clean-cut-memory-2026-08-28.md,20316,6e5a5b7cf7f3ad45008b14597a3616ee603da76cc500b69770de7280711785e4
  memory_policy: MemoryEndpoints is authorized and strongly recommended for portable cross-device continuity; configured or reachable service state is not live lifecycle proof.
  campaign_truth: 0/20 qualified; 0/50 browser; 0/25 live memory; 0/40 outside lanes; 0/20 catalog.
checkpoint_2026_08_28_authenticated_companion_browser_client:
  source: commit=ac32cd3592de4c13bba84ffc8c2e4aef3a4eafd7; tree=b399f413bb33caac92583ea828af9c1c61d833f8
  remote_equality: Local HEAD and tree equal a freshly fetched origin branch commit and tree; the worktree was clean after push verification.
  verification: Node standard=1684 pass/0 fail/3 intentional skips/1687 total, including the exact web release closure and real Chromium smoke; diff and staged-diff hygiene passed.
  result: The strict memory-only browser Companion capability client and independent fake-Companion tests are now source-controlled under app ownership. Pairing, exact lost-response recovery, session sequencing, rotation recovery, revocation, deterministic six-member acquisition identity, cancellation, and fixed artifact chunks fail closed.
  release_truth: The client is published in the source release inventory but is not loaded by the product UI. The obsolete CompanionBridge and one-file acquisition UI remain the current active blocker; this checkpoint is not deployment, acquisition, conversion, model, browser-chat, P2P, or campaign evidence.
  next_gate: Implement matching .NET operation wire/service/artifact transport under cross-language vectors, then activate the sole client and delete CompanionBridge plus all one-file acquisition/sharing semantics in the same green clean cut.
  deep_link: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-enterprise-intake-and-production-runtime-clean-cut-memory-2026-08-28.md,20316,6e5a5b7cf7f3ad45008b14597a3616ee603da76cc500b69770de7280711785e4
