  blockers: Ten ADRs, hostile parser/runtime/conformance implementation, model training and human review, WebGPU target evidence, secure companion/P2P work, authorized MemoryEndpoints contract, outside observers, catalog authority, physical linux-arm64, release credentials, and every 20/50/25/40/20 acceptance receipt remain required.
  source_site_removal_or_keep_active_reason: Remove all 25 completed reports and the duplicate goal source after durable hash verification. Keep the goal itself active through the goal system and durable memory because the human explicitly requested it.
