  actual_source_work: Read all twelve reports as six independent pairs; verified public Liquid facts against the exact LFM2.5-1.2B revision, config, model card, custom license, paper, and pinned Transformers implementation; compared every recommendation with local untouched source-screen evidence, runtime boundaries, pending human review, quantization evidence, and campaign receipts; retained evidence-compatible methods and explicitly rejected unsupported architecture, training, quantization, contamination, and sequential-evaluation prescriptions.
  hot_memory_update: Routes are present in .uai/short-term-memory.uai, .uai/long-term-memory.uai, .uai/index.uai, .uai/report-synthesis.uai, .uai/test-plan.uai, .uai/file-handoff.uai, .uai/totem.uai, and this ledger.
