  checks: Source-to-durable SHA-256 13/13; 12 reports plus one prompt; paired-domain synthesis and TDD delta created; exact LFM2.5-1.2B 4/8 rejection preserved; 318 unresolved equation placeholders, zero-URL alternates, mutable source links, and unsupported prescriptions recorded rather than adopted.
  blockers: none_for_intake_distribution; human review, GPU recovery, a newly qualified hybrid source, authorized custom-license review, physical target measurements, advertised MemoryEndpoints lifecycle routes, outside P2P proof, and catalog publication remain operational blockers.
  source_site_removal_or_keep_active_reason: Remove all twelve processed reports plus prompt provenance from active handoff only after durable hashes, ledger entries, hot-memory routes, and regression checks verify.
