  durable_manifest: docs/report-intake/2026-07-14/dogfood-quality-campaign/MANIFEST.md
  durable_manifest_sha256: 5d249a13d887ef86cf2d3d18d54b6b73f9c2403e4af62ab9d1caf7f8dad1df23
  durable_synthesis: docs/report-intake/2026-07-14/dogfood-quality-campaign/tinyrustlm-dogfood-quality-campaign-intake-synthesis-2026-07-14.md
  durable_tdd_plan: docs/report-intake/2026-07-14/dogfood-quality-campaign/tinyrustlm-dogfood-quality-campaign-tdd-plan-2026-07-14.md
  durable_memory: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-dogfood-quality-campaign-intake-memory-2026-07-14.md
  durable_memory_sha256: 3cba671650e6f4c60c439b47e08af11889a00c2022c8dc6288fef9b38ac1fa51
  source_count: 12
  prompt_provenance_count: 1
  durable_count: 13
  paired_domain_count: 6
  missing_durable_copies: 0
  disposition: preserved-to-durable-memory
  processed_outcome: preserved-to-durable-memory
  actual_source_work: Read all twelve reports as six independent pairs; checked their claims against the human campaign goal, current browser/runtime/model/P2P/MemoryEndpoints/package source, local artifact identities, production receipts, and external-contract availability; retained convergent engineering guidance and explicitly corrected unsupported observations, guessed routes, wrong process counts, weak proof, and catalog-theater model diversity.
  hot_memory_update: Routes are present in .uai/short-term-memory.uai, .uai/long-term-memory.uai, .uai/index.uai, .uai/report-synthesis.uai, .uai/test-plan.uai, .uai/file-handoff.uai, .uai/operations.uai, .uai/totem.uai, .uai/workspace-guidance.uai, and this ledger.
  llm_wiki_or_aiwikis_preservation_evidence: Historical source hashes remain in the ledger and manifest; a 2026-07-15 audit recorded separate current durable hashes after discovering that Git had normalized all twelve report bodies. Prompt provenance remained byte-exact; corrected campaign authority is checksum-bound in the wiki node.
  checks: Source identities retained 12/12 plus prompt provenance 1/1; current durable sizes and SHA-256 values verify 13/13; historical report-body normalization is explicit; paired lane count 6/6; corrected synthesis and TDD plan created; every source has one disposition and proof of use.
  blockers: none_for_intake_distribution; campaign execution remains blocked or incomplete on distinct qualified models, live MemoryEndpoints lifecycle contract, external observer, physical Linux ARM64 evidence, catalog write authority, signing, and authorized public publication.
  current_execution_memory: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-dogfood-quality-campaign-execution-memory-2026-07-15.md
  current_execution_memory_sha256: 25431c75136a6cbe104fa881f00f2fa73b6a355c5751dc5e8f7d1da90f35b02a
  current_execution_outcome: Source-first use now covers 56 terminally rejected attempts across 51 distinct candidate artifact identities. Exact apple/OpenELM-1_1B-Instruct revision effd796da2a77361d7360e45e54c7cc14bc5df2a is rejected before acquisition under immutable receipt bfe9bf44898b9fa9cb8806cb589d4ddb599be87ff5d321fe3263cc357bab74fb because it requires publisher Python, lacks a pinned native loader, and publishes no tokenizer or chat template; no compatibility work is authorized. SmolLM 1.7B remains rejected at 1/8 and Granite 4.0 H 1B at 2/8. Dashboard 556f8ca3841d153b2893a11b1dde9ac1bac7035728107e57737ed4191d0c4a43 remains incomplete with 189 current and 527 retained receipts, all live counters zero, an exact 599-artifact secret-scan-bound final predicate, and tracked third-party weights in WIP commit 15bcf5049eb8616f856daf8cbc8604b877a7af0b blocking release pending authorized cleanup and audit.
  source_site_removal_or_keep_active_reason: All thirteen active source inputs were removed after the original source identities were recorded, paired synthesis and TDD planning completed, and ledger/hot routes verified. The later Git-normalization defect is preserved rather than hidden, with separate durable identities and a repository-wide intake no-normalization rule.
